# 22. CUSTOMER FEEDBACK AND SATISFACTION PAGE

Create a dedicated Customer Feedback and Satisfaction page.

This page must be connected directly to completed orders.

The feedback invitation must appear at the correct stage, depending on whether the customer chose delivery or store collection.

## A. STORE COLLECTION PROCESS

1. Customer selects store collection.
2. Customer completes checkout.
3. Payment is verified according to the payment policy.
4. Product is prepared.
5. Actual collection is confirmed using an authorized staff confirmation or secure collection code.
6. BuyHive updates the order to Collected.
7. Customer becomes eligible for feedback.
8. Display or send the feedback invitation.

Do not display the feedback form just because checkout or payment was completed. Actual receipt of the product must be confirmed.

## B. DELIVERY PROCESS

1. Customer selects delivery.
2. Customer completes checkout.
3. Payment is verified.
4. Product is collected from the seller.
5. Product undergoes the second inspection.
6. Product passes inspection.
7. BuyHive coordinates delivery.
8. Customer receives the product.
9. Delivery is confirmed.
10. Customer becomes eligible for feedback.
11. Display or send the feedback invitation.

Do not send post-delivery feedback requests before delivery is confirmed.

