Sellers must be able to register, list products, submit products for inspection, manage orders, monitor sales, view earnings and receive payouts.

BuyHive must maintain control over the customer relationship, product-inspection process, order coordination, delivery coordination and customer satisfaction.

The system must use PHP Laravel, Vue 3, Inertia, MySQL and Laravel Fortify.

The current project must contain only the customer marketplace and Seller Portal. The internal management website will be developed as a separate application later.

**The objective is to create a genuine, scalable marketplace ecosystem under the BUYHIVE brand, not an ordinary inventory-owning online shop.**